cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project or its model, please cite it as below."
title: "pretrain-lab: a 140M bilingual language model trained from scratch on one 16GB GPU"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch Chinese-English 137.8M-parameter decoder-only language model
  (3B-token pre-training, 250M-token SFT, LoRA ablations, GGUF/Ollama demo)
  trained on a single RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GPU in about 60 hours. The repository
  includes the full data pipeline, training/evaluation scripts, evidence,
  and an honest evaluation report covering contamination discovery, a
  90-question holdout, quantization fidelity, and capability limits.
authors:
